---
const karnatakaflag = '/img/misc/Karnatakaflag.png';
---

<div>
      <div class="bg-none py-[0px] sm:py-8 mx-4">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8">
  <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center 2xl:justify-center xl:justify-center md:justify-center lg:justify-center sm:justify-start">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-center mb-2 sm:mb-0">
        <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src={karnatakaflag} alt="Karnataka Flag" class="h-12 mr-2"/>
        <span class="font-poppins tracking-tight text-4xl xl:text-[2.9rem] text-gray-700 2xl:text-[40px] font-semibold">ಕನ್ನಡದ No.1</span>
    </div>
    <span class="font-poppins font-semibold tracking-tight text-4xl xl:text-[2.9rem] text-gray-700 2xl:text-[40px] sm:ml-2 text-center sm:text-left"> Tech-Skilling Platform</span>
</div>


     <br class='hidden sm:block'/>
     <br/>
    <dl class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-y-2  text-center lg:grid-cols-4 gap-0.5 ">
      <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-xs flex-col  rounded-xl">
        <dd class='order-first'><i class="fa-solid fa-users text-purple-500 text-5xl"></i></dd>
        <br/>
        <dd class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl"><span data-countup="100000" data-locale="en-US">100,000</span> +</dd>
        <dt class="font-poppins tracking-tight text-base leading-7 text-gray-600">Active Learners</dt>
      </div>
      <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-xs flex-col rounded-xl">
        <dd class='order-first'><i class="fa-brands fa-youtube text-red-600 text-5xl"></i></dd>
        <br/>
        <dd class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl"><span data-countup="89000" data-locale="en-US">89,000</span> +</dd>
        <dt class="font-poppins tracking-tight text-base leading-7 text-gray-600">YouTube Subscribers</dt>
      </div>
      <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-xs flex-col rounded-xl">
        <dd class='order-first'><i class="fa-brands fa-instagram text-pink-600 text-5xl"></i></dd>
        <br/>
        <dd class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl"><span data-countup="56000" data-locale="en-US">56,000</span> +</dd>
        <dt class="font-poppins tracking-tight text-base leading-7 text-gray-600">Instagram Followers</dt>
      </div>
      <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-xs flex-col rounded-xl">
        <dd class='order-first'><i class="fa-brands fa-telegram text-blue-400 text-5xl"></i></dd>
        <br/>
        <dd class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl"><span data-countup="40000" data-locale="en-US">40,000</span> +</dd>
        <dt class="font-poppins tracking-tight text-base leading-7 text-gray-600">Telegram Followers</dt>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>
  <br class='hidden sm:block'/>
  <br/>
  <div class='mb-5 2xl:text-xl xl:text-xl text-md  font-poppins tracking-tight leading-7 text-gray-600'>  1 Lakh+ Kannadigas are already learning AWS, Azure & GenAI from industry experts — in their own language. You're next. <i class="fa-solid fa-medal text-yellow-500"></i></div>
  <br/>
        
</div>
    </div>
